% expect-output: true
% expect-output: invalidfont
% Scenario: a Type 1 dictionary the job builds is structurally a font,
% so definefont accepts it, but it has no glyph program and no resident
% metrics, so show cannot measure or draw it until font programs are
% parsed.
% Expect: true (the FID exists), then invalidfont from show.
/F1 << /FontType 1 /FontMatrix [0.001 0 0 0.001 0 0] /Encoding StandardEncoding >>
definefont /FID known =
/F1 findfont 10 scalefont setfont
0 0 moveto { (x) show } stopped pop $error /errorname get =
